        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A chromosomal deletion syndrome that has_material_basis_in by deletion of the chromosome 1p36 region and is characterized by severe intellectual disability, a small head, deep-set eyes with straight eyebrows, midface hypoplasia, a broad, flat nose, a pointed chin and low-set ears.</owl:annotatedTarget>
