        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An IDH-mutant anaplastic astrocytoma that is characterized by the presence of necrosis and/or microvascular proliferation or homozygous deletion of CDKN2A and/or CDKN2B genes. The term glioblastoma no longer applies to central nervous system WHO grade 4 IDH-mutant astrocytomas.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICDO:9445/3</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
