        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An endocrine organ benign neoplasm arising from the pineal gland that is composed of small, uniform, mature cells resembling pineocytes with occasional large pineocytomatous rosettes. It may show a wide range of divergent phenotypes, including neuronal, glial, melanocytic, photoreceptor and mesenchymal differentiation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
