        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_5078"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A ganglioglioma occurring predominantly in the cerebral hemispheres of infants, that are driven by MAPK pathway activation and composed of a mixed astrocytic and neuronal component (DIG) or an astrocytic component only (DIA) embedded in an extensive desmoplastic stroma, often containing foci of undifferentiated embryonal-like tumour cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
