        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A central nervous system embryonal tumor that is characterized by the presence of multilayered rosette formation and typically the presence of amplification of the C19MC region on chromosome 19 (19q13.42) or rarely a DICER1 mutation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
