        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An Usher syndrome characterized by retinitis pigmentosa and onset of sensorineural hearing impairment in the teens that has_material_basis_in mutation in the MTTS2 gene in the mitochondrial genome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
