        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_10754"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A otitis media which is an expansile, inflammatory mass of granulation tissue in the middle ear. It is a foreign body reaction to cholesterol deposits that occur in obstructed fluid-filled air cells of the temporal bone. It is present with a conductive hearing loss and a blue eardrum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
