        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_4"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A gastrointestinal system infectious disease that involves inflammation of the lining of the stomach and small and large intestines, which is caused by viruses, bacteria, or parasites. Chemicals and drugs also cause gastroenteritis. The symptoms include diarrhea, loss of appetite, nausea, vomiting, cramps, and discomfort in the abdomen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
