        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_655"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A steroid inherited metabolic disorder characterized by decreased conversion of biologically active cortisol to inactive cortisone resulting in low aldosterone levels, metabolic alkalosis, hypernatremia, hypokalemia and early-onset severe hypertension that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the HSD11B2 gene on chromosome 16.</obo:IAO_0000115>
