        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_104"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A commensal bacterial infectious disease that is characterized by widespread erythema, peeling, and necrosis of the skin, that is caused by a toxin produced by a bacterium of the genus Staphylococcus (S. aureus). The infection has_symptom redness of skin, has_symptom fluid-filled blister formation, has_symptom fever and has_symptom irritability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
